<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Kia Group shares mixed in early trading.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Kia Group shares mixed in early trading.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in South Korea's Kia Group were mixed in early morning trading on Tuesday on the news that its chairman had pleaded for continuing credit and said group affiliates would seek restructuring, brokers said.</p>
</text>
